<DocsLayout
  title="Stores API (Bun) - hitlimit-bun | Memory, SQLite, Redis, Valkey, DragonflyDB, Postgres Store Reference"
  description="API reference for hitlimit-bun storage backends. HitLimitStore interface, memoryStore(), sqliteStore(), redisStore(), valkeyStore(), dragonflyStore(), and postgresStore() function signatures and options."
  keywords="hitlimit-bun store api, bun rate limit store, bun memory store api, bun sqlite store api, bun redis store api, bun valkey store api, bun dragonflydb store api, bun postgres store api, hitlimit store interface"
